config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBLDAC
	bool "libldac"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_BLUEZ_ALSA
	help
	  AOSP's LDAC encoder (libldacBT_enc, Apache-2.0) with its adaptive bit rate helper (libldacBT_abr), as
	  EHfive/ldacBT builds them. With it bluez-alsa sends LDAC to headphones that take it (this package's .mk
	  adds --enable-ldac to bluez-alsa). Encoder only: AOSP ships no LDAC decoder.
	  https://github.com/EHfive/ldacBT
